Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.53,0:00:04.30,Default,SOTA,0,0,0,,Şey... çok güzel görünüyorsun...\Nmayoyla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.13,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,O da ne?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx75\fscy75\pos(24.666,30.667)}*: Japonya'da hava açsın diye asılan kâğıt bebeklere denir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.75,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,Teru teru bozu* mu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.09,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,Bir dakika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:27.24,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,Bu Koharu mu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.50,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,O ne yapıyor böyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.48,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs66\c&HC4C826&\bord0\b1\fad(482,140)}{\c&H9657E9&}Soğuk Sato-san, {\c&HC4C826&}Sadece {\c&H9657E9&}Bana Karşı {\c&HC4C826&}Tatlı
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.01,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs78\t(0,3000,\fs66)\shad0\bord27\c&H5E8C79&\frz336\frx14\fry0\move(1394.001,143.001,1356,240,0,2988)\3c&H90FFD5&}Sato-san! İyi misin?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.01,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs78\t(0,3000,\fs66)\shad0\bord57\c&H5E8C79&\frz336\frx14\fry0\3c&H90FFD5&\move(1232.001,433.002,1216.002,482.001,27,2988)}Neredesin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.01,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H90FFD5&\frz336\frx14\fry0\move(1225.5,426,1230,458.001,27,2988)}m 0 0 l 615 0 l 615 120 l 0 120
